# InsForge Backend Rules

- Treat auth/session, Postgres schema, storage, compute, AI gateway, and deployment as backend platform concerns.
- Keep backend changes isolated from frontend UI edits.
- Prefer platform primitives over custom backend plumbing when InsForge already provides them.
- Ask before changing schema, auth provider, or production data flow.
- Validate backend inputs and permissions at the boundary.
- Keep migrations and data mutations explicit and reviewed.
